<title>USA: Hilton plans to name ITT slate today.</title>
<headline>Hilton plans to name ITT slate today.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hilton Hotels Corp senior vice president corporate affairs Marc Grossman said Hilton plans to name its proposed slate of ITT Corp board members on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We'll have an announcement a little later today,&quot; Grossman told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said Hilton's statement would include the names of people it wants elected to ITT's board of directors as part of its $6.5 billion bid to acquire ITT, but he declined to elaborate on the planned announcement.</p>
</text>
